      "notes": "Anusvara before a palatal surfaces as the coronal nasal [n] rather than assimilating to [ɲ]: the Marathi gold writes अंजीर [ənd͡ʑiɾ], and across 4872 words [ɲ] occurs once against 962 [n]. See MR_ANUSVARA_VELAR."
